{"text": "CAMC\nFoundation\n\nRunforYour L\n\nCharleston, WV \u00a2 Saturday, June 22nd, 2019 \u00a2 8:00 am\n\n5-Mile Run/2.5-Mile Walk\n\nRun & Walk begins at\nHaddad Riverfront Park.\n\nENTRY FORM (Please print)\n\nName\n\nAddress\n\nCity/State/Zip\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nDate of Birth\n\nMale Female\n(circle one)\n\nAge (Day of Race)\n\nRun Walk\n(circle one)\n\n*Winners in each division will be recognized.\n\nRegistration is $25 if postmarked before June 17, 2019\nand $30 thereafter. Online registration is available on\ngive.camcfoundation.org/run\n\nNo charge for online registration.\n\nLate registration and pre-race packet pick up will be\nheld on June 21st from 3 to 7 p.m. at the CAMC\nCancer Center parking lot (3415 MacCorkle Ave. SE)\nand on race day at the start line from 7 to 8 a.m.\n\nSend checks and entry forms to:\nCAMC Foundation\n3414 Staunton Ave. SE\nCharleston, WV 25304\n\nCAMC\nFoundation\n\nCall (304) 388-9860\nfor more information.\n\nTeam Up for\nColorectal\nCancer\nAwareness\n\nRun for Your Life Run/Walk Participant Release\n\n| have read this PARTICIPANT RELEASE form and fully understand\nthat by singing this form | am giving up legal rights and remedies\nthat might otherwise be available to me.\n\nParticipant signature:\n\nDate:\n\nParticipant ____ IS ___IS NOT age 18 or older.*\n\nShirt Style: M or F Cotton or Dry Fit\n\nT-Shirt Size iS} M L XL XXL\n\n*If a participant is under the age of 18 a parent or legal\nguardian must sign below in addition to participant.\n\nSignature:\n\nPrint Name:\n\nRelationship to Participant:\n\nDate:\n\nShirt preference guaranteed if registered by June 8th\n\n| am aware that road running is a hazardous activity, and | am voluntarily participating in the Run\nfor Your Life five (5) mile run (\u201cRun\u201d) with knowledge of the danger involved. | agree to accept all\nrisks including but not limited to personal injury, death or property damage that may occur as a\nresult of participation in the Run.\n\nIn consideration of allowing my participation in the Run, | hereby release, for myself and my\nsuccessors and assigns, Charleston Area Medical Center Foundation, Inc. (\u201cCAMC Foundation\u201d),\nits directors, employees, agents and affiliates, and TSR Timing Group, from any and all claims of\nany type that may arise from my participation. | hereby grant permission to CAMC Foundation\nand its affiliates to take, use and reproduce images of myself in connection with the Run for any\npurpose, including fundraising and advertising.\n\n32991-A17",
